    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "scale of 1 to 10, how much of a disaster would it be if i find out there's something nasty hidden in there that i can't see? like, how do i know if it's just a minor setback or if something \"malicious\" or \"sinister\" is actually happening inside the rumen?",
